sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant W as Window (webview UI)
    participant Co as Rust core
    participant T as Tauri host (main.rs)
    participant Pd as ptyd

    Note over P,W: Show Alone (D2)
    P->>W: ⌥⌘M on pane server
    loop each other pane of the tab, reading order
        W->>Co: PaneToTab {paneId, index + n}
        Co-->>W: workspace patch (new tab, same shell)
    end
    W->>W: view = focused tab alone (localStorage)

    Note over P,W: Zoom follows focus (D7)
    P->>W: ⌘+
    alt focus in a pane, row or folder
        W->>Co: SetPaneZoom {paneIds, zoom}
        Co-->>W: layout patch (leaf zoom)
        W->>W: font × zoom, refit
        W->>Pd: resize (cols, rows)
    else focus on window chrome
        W->>Co: SetWindowZoom {windowId, zoom}
        Co->>T: window zoom changed
        T->>W: set_zoom on this webview only
    end
    W->>P: notice "Pane server · 110%"
